{"number":80,"name":"سُورَةُ عَبَسَ","englishName":"Abasa","englishNameTranslation":"He frowned","numberOfAyahs":42,"items":[{"id":"q:80:1","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":1,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ عَبَسَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","en":"The Prophet frowned and turned away","bn":"তিনি ভ্রূকুঞ্চিত করলেন এবং মুখ ফিরিয়ে নিলেন।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/1"},{"id":"q:80:2","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":2,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"أَن جَآءَهُ ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ","en":"Because there came to him the blind man, [interrupting].","bn":"কারণ, তাঁর কাছে এক অন্ধ আগমন করল।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/2"},{"id":"q:80:3","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":3,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَمَا يُدْرِيكَ لَعَلَّهُۥ يَزَّكَّىٰٓ","en":"But what would make you perceive, [O Muhammad], that perhaps he might be purified","bn":"আপনি কি জানেন, সে হয়তো পরিশুদ্ধ হত,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/3"},{"id":"q:80:4","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":4,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"أَوْ يَذَّكَّرُ فَتَنفَعَهُ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰٓ","en":"Or be reminded and the remembrance would benefit him?","bn":"অথবা উপদেশ গ্রহণ করতো এবং উপদেশ তার উপকার হত।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/4"},{"id":"q:80:5","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":5,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"أَمَّا مَنِ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰ","en":"As for he who thinks himself without need,","bn":"পরন্তু যে বেপরোয়া,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/5"},{"id":"q:80:6","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":6,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَأَنتَ لَهُۥ تَصَدَّىٰ","en":"To him you give attention.","bn":"আপনি তার চিন্তায় মশগুল।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/6"},{"id":"q:80:7","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":7,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَمَا عَلَيْكَ أَلَّا يَزَّكَّىٰ","en":"And not upon you [is any blame] if he will not be purified.","bn":"সে শুদ্ধ না হলে আপনার কোন দোষ নেই।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/7"},{"id":"q:80:8","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":8,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَأَمَّا مَن جَآءَكَ يَسْعَىٰ","en":"But as for he who came to you striving [for knowledge]","bn":"যে আপনার কাছে দৌড়ে আসলো","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/8"},{"id":"q:80:9","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":9,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَهُوَ يَخْشَىٰ","en":"While he fears [Allah],","bn":"এমতাবস্থায় যে, সে ভয় করে,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/9"},{"id":"q:80:10","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":10,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَأَنتَ عَنْهُ تَلَهَّىٰ","en":"From him you are distracted.","bn":"আপনি তাকে অবজ্ঞা করলেন।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/10"},{"id":"q:80:11","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":11,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"كَلَّآ إِنَّهَا تَذْكِرَةٌۭ","en":"No! Indeed, these verses are a reminder;","bn":"কখনও এরূপ করবেন না, এটা উপদেশবানী।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/11"},{"id":"q:80:12","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":12,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَمَن شَآءَ ذَكَرَهُۥ","en":"So whoever wills may remember it.","bn":"অতএব, যে ইচ্ছা করবে, সে একে গ্রহণ করবে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/12"},{"id":"q:80:13","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":13,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فِى صُحُفٍۢ مُّكَرَّمَةٍۢ","en":"[It is recorded] in honored sheets,","bn":"এটা লিখিত আছে সম্মানিত,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/13"},{"id":"q:80:14","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":14,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"مَّرْفُوعَةٍۢ مُّطَهَّرَةٍۭ","en":"Exalted and purified,","bn":"উচ্চ পবিত্র পত্রসমূহে,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/14"},{"id":"q:80:15","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":15,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"بِأَيْدِى سَفَرَةٍۢ","en":"[Carried] by the hands of messenger-angels,","bn":"লিপিকারের হস্তে,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/15"},{"id":"q:80:16","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":16,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"كِرَامٍۭ بَرَرَةٍۢ","en":"Noble and dutiful.","bn":"যারা মহৎ, পূত চরিত্র।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/16"},{"id":"q:80:17","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":17,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"قُتِلَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ مَآ أَكْفَرَهُۥ","en":"Cursed is man; how disbelieving is he.","bn":"মানুষ ধ্বংস হোক, সে কত অকৃতজ্ঞ!","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/17"},{"id":"q:80:18","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":18,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"مِنْ أَىِّ شَىْءٍ خَلَقَهُۥ","en":"From what substance did He create him?","bn":"তিনি তাকে কি বস্তু থেকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন?","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/18"},{"id":"q:80:19","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":19,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"مِن نُّطْفَةٍ خَلَقَهُۥ فَقَدَّرَهُۥ","en":"From a sperm-drop He created him and destined for him;","bn":"শুক্র থেকে তাকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন, অতঃপর তাকে সুপরিমিত করেছেন।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/19"},{"id":"q:80:20","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":20,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ثُمَّ ٱلسَّبِيلَ يَسَّرَهُۥ","en":"Then He eased the way for him;","bn":"অতঃপর তার পথ সহজ করেছেন,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/20"},{"id":"q:80:21","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":21,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ثُمَّ أَمَاتَهُۥ فَأَقْبَرَهُۥ","en":"Then He causes his death and provides a grave for him.","bn":"অতঃপর তার মৃত্যু ঘটান ও কবরস্থ করেন তাকে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/21"},{"id":"q:80:22","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":22,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ثُمَّ إِذَا شَآءَ أَنشَرَهُۥ","en":"Then when He wills, He will resurrect him.","bn":"এরপর যখন ইচ্ছা করবেন তখন তাকে পুনরুজ্জীবিত করবেন।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/22"},{"id":"q:80:23","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":23,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"كَلَّا لَمَّا يَقْضِ مَآ أَمَرَهُۥ","en":"No! Man has not yet accomplished what He commanded him.","bn":"সে কখনও কৃতজ্ঞ হয়নি, তিনি তাকে যা আদেশ করেছেন, সে তা পূর্ণ করেনি।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/23"},{"id":"q:80:24","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":24,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ إِلَىٰ طَعَامِهِۦٓ","en":"Then let mankind look at his food -","bn":"মানুষ তার খাদ্যের প্রতি লক্ষ্য করুক,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/24"},{"id":"q:80:25","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":25,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"أَنَّا صَبَبْنَا ٱلْمَآءَ صَبًّۭا","en":"How We poured down water in torrents,","bn":"আমি আশ্চর্য উপায়ে পানি বর্ষণ করেছি,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/25"},{"id":"q:80:26","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":26,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ثُمَّ شَقَقْنَا ٱلْأَرْضَ شَقًّۭا","en":"Then We broke open the earth, splitting [it with sprouts],","bn":"এরপর আমি ভূমিকে বিদীর্ণ করেছি,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/26"},{"id":"q:80:27","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":27,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَأَنۢبَتْنَا فِيهَا حَبًّۭا","en":"And caused to grow within it grain","bn":"অতঃপর তাতে উৎপন্ন করেছি শস্য,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/27"},{"id":"q:80:28","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":28,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَعِنَبًۭا وَقَضْبًۭا","en":"And grapes and herbage","bn":"আঙ্গুর, শাক-সব্জি,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/28"},{"id":"q:80:29","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":29,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَزَيْتُونًۭا وَنَخْلًۭا","en":"And olive and palm trees","bn":"যয়তুন, খর্জূর,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/29"},{"id":"q:80:30","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":30,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَحَدَآئِقَ غُلْبًۭا","en":"And gardens of dense shrubbery","bn":"ঘন উদ্যান,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/30"},{"id":"q:80:31","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":31,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَفَٰكِهَةًۭ وَأَبًّۭا","en":"And fruit and grass -","bn":"ফল এবং ঘাস","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/31"},{"id":"q:80:32","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":32,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"مَّتَٰعًۭا لَّكُمْ وَلِأَنْعَٰمِكُمْ","en":"[As] enjoyment for you and your grazing livestock.","bn":"তোমাদেরও তোমাদের চতুস্পদ জন্তুদের উপাকারার্থে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/32"},{"id":"q:80:33","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":33,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَإِذَا جَآءَتِ ٱلصَّآخَّةُ","en":"But when there comes the Deafening Blast","bn":"অতঃপর যেদিন কর্ণবিদারক নাদ আসবে,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/33"},{"id":"q:80:34","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":34,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"يَوْمَ يَفِرُّ ٱلْمَرْءُ مِنْ أَخِيهِ","en":"On the Day a man will flee from his brother","bn":"সেদিন পলায়ন করবে মানুষ তার ভ্রাতার কাছ থেকে,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/34"},{"id":"q:80:35","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":35,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَأُمِّهِۦ وَأَبِيهِ","en":"And his mother and his father","bn":"তার মাতা, তার পিতা,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/35"},{"id":"q:80:36","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":36,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَصَٰحِبَتِهِۦ وَبَنِيهِ","en":"And his wife and his children,","bn":"তার পত্নী ও তার সন্তানদের কাছ থেকে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/36"},{"id":"q:80:37","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":37,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"لِكُلِّ ٱمْرِئٍۢ مِّنْهُمْ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ شَأْنٌۭ يُغْنِيهِ","en":"For every man, that Day, will be a matter adequate for him.","bn":"সেদিন প্রত্যেকেরই নিজের এক চিন্তা থাকবে, যা তাকে ব্যতিব্যস্ত করে রাখবে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/37"},{"id":"q:80:38","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":38,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ مُّسْفِرَةٌۭ","en":"[Some] faces, that Day, will be bright -","bn":"অনেক মুখমন্ডল সেদিন হবে উজ্জ্বল,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/38"},{"id":"q:80:39","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":39,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ضَاحِكَةٌۭ مُّسْتَبْشِرَةٌۭ","en":"Laughing, rejoicing at good news.","bn":"সহাস্য ও প্রফুল্ল।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/39"},{"id":"q:80:40","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":40,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَوُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَلَيْهَا غَبَرَةٌۭ","en":"And [other] faces, that Day, will have upon them dust.","bn":"এবং অনেক মুখমন্ডল সেদিন হবে ধুলি ধূসরিত।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/40"},{"id":"q:80:41","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":41,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"تَرْهَقُهَا قَتَرَةٌ","en":"Blackness will cover them.","bn":"তাদেরকে কালিমা আচ্ছন্ন করে রাখবে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/41"},{"id":"q:80:42","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":80,"ayah":42,"surahName":"Abasa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْكَفَرَةُ ٱلْفَجَرَةُ","en":"Those are the disbelievers, the wicked ones.","bn":"তারাই কাফের পাপিষ্ঠের দল।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/80/42"}]}